title: Yuki
---
<<declare $grandma_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $grandma_interaction_times == 0>>
  Yuki: Hello, dear. It's such a beautiful evening. A perfect time to write a wish.
  -> A wish? But… the world is ending!
    Yuki: Even more reason to write one then.
    Yuki: Your life, your dream, your love... it doesn't end. It just changes form. 
  -> I'd love to write one!
  Yuki: Write your wish, dear. Hang it on the tree! it will be carried on to wherever it needs to go
  <<set $grandma_interaction_times += 1>>
<<elseif $grandma_interaction_times == 1>>
  Yuki: Do you have any regrets, my dear?
  -> Yeah…
    You: There are lots of things I could have done. And now I can't…
    Yuki: Do not worry, dear. There will always be more you could have done.
    Yuki: Learn to let go of your regrets. Don't let them chain you down.
  -> Not really.
    Yuki: It is a great fortune to have lived a life with no regrets, my dear.
  <<set $grandma_interaction_times += 1>>
<<elseif $grandma_interaction_times == 2>>
  Yuki: You know, this cherry blossom was just a wee sprout when I was a little girl.
  Yuki: People tried to cut it down many, many times, but it came back every time.
  Yuki: This sunset is just one of many. You, too, will bloom again.
<<else>>
  Yuki: This tree has seen the stories of thousands of people come and go.
  Yuki: What will your story be?
<<endif>>

===